{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37936","headline":"夏日书怀寄道友 · 崔涂","name":"夏日书怀寄道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达即匡邦退即耕，是非何足挠平生。\n终期道向希夷得，未省心因宠辱惊。\n峰转暂无当户影，雉飞时有隔林声。\n十年惟悟吟诗句，待得中原欲铸兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}